# Who may sign a release of Slate: its public key, in ssh-keygen's allowed-signers form. Both
# updaters (scripts/update.py, bin/slate-update-install) install a release only if its archive
# carries a signature from this key, for releases (the namespace). tools/release-assets.sh signs.
slate-release namespaces="slate-release" ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIEV+FqPjWr/WqIDBTdzOYGjLtJFhDWbycYZFV+FWb6ee
